            "value": "分析器验证详情"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Install the supported Mole analyzer": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Install the supported Mole analyzer"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "安装受支持的 Mole 分析器"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You only need the official V1.57.0 analyzer for this Mac. Homebrew and source-built versions do not match this app's compatibility check.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You only need the official V1.57.0 analyzer for this Mac. Homebrew and source-built versions do not match this app's compatibility check."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "只需安装适用于这台 Mac 的官方 V1.57.0 分析器。Homebrew 和自行编译的版本不符合本应用的兼容性校验。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Review the official download": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Review the official download"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "查看官方下载说明"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Read the release notes and review the command in step 3. The command downloads one official file, checks it, and makes it ready for MoeKit. It does not run Mole or ask for an administrator password.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Read the release notes and review the command in step 3. The command downloads one official file, checks it, and makes it ready for MoeKit. It does not run Mole or ask for an administrator password."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "阅读发布说明，并检查第 3 步中的命令。该命令会下载并校验一个官方文件，为 MoeKit 准备分析器；不会运行 Mole，也不需要管理员密码。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open Terminal": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Open Terminal"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "打开终端"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Press ⌘ Space to open Spotlight, type Terminal, then press Return.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Press ⌘ Space to open Spotlight, type Terminal, then press Return."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "按 ⌘ 空格打开聚焦搜索，输入“终端”（Terminal），然后按回车。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Copy, paste and run the command": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Copy, paste and run the command"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "复制、粘贴并运行命令"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Copying only changes the clipboard. In Terminal, press ⌘V to paste the reviewed command, then press Return. Running it downloads from GitHub and writes new folders in your home directory; it never overwrites an existing installation.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Copying only changes the clipboard. In Terminal, press ⌘V to paste the reviewed command, then press Return. Running it downloads from GitHub and writes new folders in your home directory; it never overwrites an existing installation."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "复制只会更新剪贴板。在终端中按 ⌘V 粘贴已检查的命令，再按回车。运行后会从 GitHub 下载文件，并在个人主目录中新建文件夹，不会覆盖已有安装。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Wait for this success message before continuing:": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wait for this success message before continuing:"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "看到以下成功提示后再继续："
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If Terminal reports an error or an existing folder, stop and read the message. Existing files and the temporary download folder are kept. Try Recheck before changing anything.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "If Terminal reports an error or an existing folder, stop and read the message. Existing files and the temporary download folder are kept. Try Recheck before changing anything."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "如果终端提示错误或文件夹已存在，请先停下来阅读提示。已有文件与临时下载文件夹都会保留。修改任何内容前，先试试“重新检查”。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Return to MoeKit and recheck": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Return to MoeKit and recheck"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "返回 MoeKit 并重新检查"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open Mole → Space → Analyze with Mole…, then choose Recheck. When Ready to analyze appears, choose a folder and review the analysis.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Open Mole → Space → Analyze with Mole…, then choose Recheck. When Ready to analyze appears, choose a folder and review the analysis."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "打开 Mole → 空间 → 使用 Mole 分析…，点击“重新检查”。显示“可以开始分析”后，选择文件夹并复查分析方案。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Return here and choose Recheck. When Ready to analyze appears, choose a folder below and review the analysis.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Return here and choose Recheck. When Ready to analyze appears, choose a folder below and review the analysis."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "返回此处并点击“重新检查”。显示“可以开始分析”后，在下方选择文件夹并复查分析方案。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Advanced download details": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Advanced download details"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "高级下载详情"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The guided download is detected at:": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The guided download is detected at:"
          }
