        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "本指引下载的分析器会在以下位置被识别："
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The official Mole script's usual analyzer location is also checked:": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The official Mole script's usual analyzer location is also checked:"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "也会检查 Mole 官方脚本常用的分析器位置："
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A matching path alone is not enough. MoeKit verifies the file again before every analysis.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A matching path alone is not enough. MoeKit verifies the file again before every analysis."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "路径匹配不代表验证通过。每次分析前，MoeKit 都会重新验证文件。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Advanced details": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "高级详情"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Checking known locations and verifying the analyzer. Mole is not running.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "正在检查常见位置并验证分析器，尚未运行 Mole。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Choose a folder to continue.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "选择文件夹后继续。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Choose a folder. Analysis starts only after your confirmation.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "选择文件夹，确认后才开始分析。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Copy, paste into Terminal with ⌘V, then press Return. The command downloads from GitHub into new folders in your home directory. Existing installations stay unchanged.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "复制后在终端按 ⌘V 粘贴，再按回车。命令从 GitHub 下载到主目录中的新文件夹，不覆盖已有安装。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Downloaded installers and recovery": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已下载安装包与恢复"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Exit Demo to set up Mole and analyze your folders.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "退出示例后可设置 Mole 并分析文件夹。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Find what is taking up space in a folder.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "查看文件夹中的空间占用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Finish Mole setup first.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "请先完成 Mole 设置。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If an error appears, stop and read it. Existing files and download folders are kept. Try Recheck first.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "如有报错，请停下并阅读提示。已有文件和下载目录都会保留，先尝试「重新检测」。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Mole V1.57.0 is verified. Choose a folder below.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已验证 Mole V1.57.0，请在下方选择文件夹。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Not found in the checked locations. Follow the setup guide, or choose your file in Advanced details.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "检测位置中未找到分析器。请按指引设置，或在「高级详情」选择已安装文件。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Set up Mole": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "设置 Mole"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Set up the analyzer": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "设置分析器"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This file is incompatible. Use the official V1.57.0 analyzer in the guide below.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此文件不兼容。请按下方指引使用官方 V1.57.0 分析器。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use the official V1.57.0 file for this Mac. Homebrew and source builds are not compatible.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "使用适用于此 Mac 的官方 V1.57.0 文件；Homebrew 和自行编译版本暂不兼容。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Verification failed. Read the reason in Advanced details before continuing.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "未通过验证。请先查看「高级详情」中的原因。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A newer version is not automatically downgraded. Verified source and tested compatibility are separate checks.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "不会自动降级较新版本。来源验证与兼容性测试是两项独立检查。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "After installation or an upgrade, recheck before choosing a folder.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "安装或升级后，请先重新检查，再选择文件夹。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Already installed somewhere else? Choose that analyzer in Advanced details. Otherwise, download the recommended official analyzer below.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已安装在其他位置？请在“高级详情”中选择该分析器。否则，可按下方指引下载推荐的官方分析器。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Analyzer needs attention": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "分析器需要检查"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Comparing this analyzer with the official Homebrew bottle. Mole is not running.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "正在将此分析器与官方 Homebrew 预编译包比对，尚未运行 Mole。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Copied": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已复制"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Copy download command": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
