    "Current version": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "当前版本"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Downloads official Homebrew metadata and a bottle to compare this file. It does not run or install Mole.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "下载官方 Homebrew 软件信息与预编译包来比对此文件，不会运行或安装 Mole。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "I understand this version is untested and want to use it for this analysis.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "我了解此版本尚未经过测试，并愿意在本次分析中使用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If macOS blocks a file, review its warning first. Do not change download routes to bypass it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "如果 macOS 阻止某个文件，请先查看警告，不要通过换下载途径绕过限制。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Installation details": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "安装详情"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Installation source": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "安装来源"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "MoeKit checks the analyzer again before each run. Analysis still needs your separate folder confirmation.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "MoeKit 在每次运行前都会重新验证分析器，分析仍需单独确认文件夹范围。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "MoeKit reuses a verified installed analyzer. Keep the same installation source when upgrading.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "MoeKit 复用已验证的本机分析器。升级时请沿用原安装来源。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "MoeKit supplies a private HOME and temporary directory, verifies a temporary analyzer copy, and cleans only its own session after the process stops. This does not restrict the untested program's filesystem access.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "MoeKit 提供私有 HOME 和临时目录，验证临时分析器副本，并在进程停止后仅清理自己的会话。这不会限制未测试程序访问文件系统的范围。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No existing analyzer found": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "未找到已有分析器"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Official Mole installation instructions": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mole 官方安装说明"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Official release notes": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "官方发布说明"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Official source verified · not yet tested": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "官方来源已验证 · 尚未测试"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open Mole → Space → Analyze with Mole… to check your version and see the next step.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "打开 Mole → 空间 → 使用 Mole 分析…，检查版本并查看下一步。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Opens a controlled terminal with the command ready to review. Only pressing Return there runs it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "打开受控终端供你复查命令，只有在该终端中按回车才会运行。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Press ⌘ Space, open Terminal, then paste with ⌘V. Review the command and press Return to download.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "按 ⌘ 空格打开“终端”，再按 ⌘V 粘贴。检查命令后按回车下载。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Recommended version": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "推荐版本"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Reports from an untested build are view-only. Installer actions require a tested analyzer.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "未测试构建的报告仅供查看，安装包操作需要使用已测试的分析器。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Review download command": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "查看下载命令"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Review the command in the terminal, then press Return to run it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在终端中复查命令，再按回车运行。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Selected manually": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已手动选择"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tested / recommended": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已测试 / 推荐"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The analyzer is not ready. Review its version, source and verification details.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "分析器尚未就绪，请查看版本、来源与验证详情。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The official source is verified, but this version has not been tested with MoeKit. Each analysis needs an extra acknowledgement.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "官方来源已验证，但该版本尚未经过 MoeKit 测试。每次分析都需要额外确认。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This downloads and checks one official analyzer in a new folder in your home directory. It does not run Mole, replace an installation or ask for an administrator password.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此命令会在个人主目录的新文件夹中下载并校验一个官方分析器，不会运行 Mole、替换已有安装，也不需要管理员密码。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This official build has not been tested with MoeKit. It runs with your user permissions, without an OS sandbox. MoeKit cannot guarantee that this untested build will leave files unchanged.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此官方构建尚未经过 MoeKit 测试。它以你的用户权限运行，没有操作系统沙箱。MoeKit 无法保证此未测试构建不会修改文件。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This version is newer than the tested release. Keep it installed; MoeKit will not offer a downgrade.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此版本比已测试版本更新。请保留现有安装，MoeKit 不会提供降级操作。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Unknown": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "未知"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Upgrade Mole…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "升级 Mole…"
          }
        }
      }
